This directory contains the unchanged journal-v2 producer fixture for the platform rail.
Each native-target directory carries the exact producer output: signed manifest,
release and checksum sidecars, versioned bootstrap, and tree/deb/rpm variants.
fixture.pub is an explicitly test-only identity generated outside the repository;
the tests prove that the production journal pin refuses it. Never present these
small synthetic payloads or their signature as a production release.
